# TA -- PAW setup (HBS construction), built 2026-10-02
# Replaces ta_ndlss_sc_v0, whose ZV=13 is inconsistent with the energy order
# of the atom (4f above 5p; partially filled 4f valence, 5s/5p frozen) and
# which collapses in the solid (ghost state). CP-PAW offers Ta only with
# ZV=5 or ZV=27.
# Parameters: CP-PAW parameters/stp.cntl entry TA_HBS (5d3 6s2 valence);
#   NPRO=2 2 2 1 (two per s/p/d channel).
# Checked: see AUDIT.md.
#
  !SPECIES NAME='TA' NPRO=2 2 2 1 LRHOX=4 RAD/RCOV=1.2
    !AUGMENT ID='TA_HBS' EL='TA' ZV=5. TYPE='HBS'
             RBOX/RCOV=1.2 RCSM/RCOV=0.25
             RCL/RCOV= 0.85 0.85 0.75 0.75
             LAMBDA= 3.5 3.5 6. 6.
      !GRID DMIN=1.E-6 DMAX=0.1 RMAX=10. !END
      !POT  POW=3. RC/RCOV=0.67 !END
      !CORE POW=3. RC/RCOV=0.67 !END
    !END
  !END
